//! name: detach-without-captures
//! expect: verify-reject
//! code: DetachWithoutCaptures
// ch05 Rule 9: a spawn region with no `captures` clause at all (absent,
// not merely empty). The `do spawn r0` that opens the region is what the
// diagnostic anchors to, so the rejection carries a real site.

decl 3 sig 1
region r0 spawn
block bb0
do spawn r0
do unreachable
